00:22:28,280 --> 00:22:37,340
Now, that's a hard thing to say in a world that we believe a lot of times, not all the time, that we're striving to be God-like in our country.

404
00:22:37,340 --> 00:22:38,600
Not always.

405
00:22:38,600 --> 00:22:40,080
Maybe not recently.

406
00:22:40,080 --> 00:22:50,800
But this is hard to hear when we say we're to be Christ first, American second, Roman second, Russian second, English second.

407
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:51,400
Pick one.

408
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:52,540
You're a brilliant man.

409
00:22:52,540 --> 00:22:52,920
Thank you.

