00:24:22,540 --> 00:24:26,680
Guess what order we set them in?

438
00:24:27,420 --> 00:24:28,060
Oops.

439
00:24:28,060 --> 00:24:35,040
It went American Christian Bible.

440
00:24:35,040 --> 00:24:37,200
Every time.

441
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:39,260
Every time.

442
00:24:39,260 --> 00:24:41,740
Your kingdom come.

443
00:24:41,740 --> 00:24:43,080
Your will be done.

444
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:45,560
We are citizens of a different kingdom.

445
00:24:45,560 --> 00:24:48,720
Any country.

446
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,900
I don't care when.

447
00:24:49,900 --> 00:24:51,320
I don't care what era.

448
00:24:51,320 --> 00:24:53,520
I don't care what century it was in.

