00:25:00,100 --> 00:25:00,960
It can do that.

452
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:02,660
It can do its best to do that.

453
00:25:02,660 --> 00:25:10,720
But that country's power, that country's king, that country's authorities are not our king first.

454
00:25:12,800 --> 00:25:13,760
Our king is Jesus.

455
00:25:13,760 --> 00:25:14,060
Our king is Jesus.

456
00:25:14,060 --> 00:25:18,940
And his kingdom is above every one of those kingdoms.

457
00:25:18,940 --> 00:25:19,920
Every time.

458
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:21,380
Always.

459
00:25:21,380 --> 00:25:26,260
We can do our best as men, because we have been called to do that.

