00:25:46,360 --> 00:25:48,860
Start waving a flag and sticking a thing in the ground.

465
00:25:48,860 --> 00:25:53,660
At some point in its history, some man or woman is going to kind of pervert something.

466
00:25:54,600 --> 00:25:58,360
There's something they think they're going to do, and it's going to be okay, and it's going to be right.

467
00:25:58,360 --> 00:26:03,300
And then it's going to turn into something, and it's going to be out of alignment with what God calls us to do.

468
00:26:03,300 --> 00:26:05,020
Because we are infallible.

469
00:26:05,020 --> 00:26:06,240
We are not infallible people.

470
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,180
We're fallible.

471
00:26:07,180 --> 00:26:09,280
Power is a thing.

472
00:26:09,280 --> 00:26:12,160
Power is a thing.

473
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:14,740
And it's hard to lead with.

474
00:26:14,740 --> 00:26:16,060
It's hard to lead through.

